<span id="A6.T3.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A6.T3.2.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Harney County has its capital city in <span id="A6.T3.2.1.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Taiwan</span>. Harney County has its capital city in <span id="A6.T3.2.1.2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Burns.</span></span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.T3.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A6.T3.2.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#AFD2E6;">ND</span></td>
<td id="A6.T3.2.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A6.T3.2.1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#AFD2E6;">Oregon</span></td>
<td id="A6.T3.2.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="A6.T3.2.1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#AFD2E6;">Llama3-8B</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr" style="--ltx-bg-color:#AFD2E6;">
<td id="A6.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A6.T3.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;--ltx-bg-color:#AFD2E6;">
<span id="A6.T3.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A6.T3.2.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Lisa Appignanesi has citizenship of <span id="A6.T3.2.1.3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">Finland</span>. Lisa Appignanesi has citizenship of <span id="A6.T3.2.1.3.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">France.</span></span></span>
</span></td>
